1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:31,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>BEYOND JOURNEY'S END</b></font>

3
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

4
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN THE BIER REGION, LOCATED
ON THE NORTHERN PLATEAU</b></font>

5
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

6
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:42,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] So, there are cities
on the Northern Plateau.</b></font>

7
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Cities full of bars.</b></font>

8
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Across the entire region,</b></font>

9
00:01:46,820 --> 00:01:49,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this is the only area
that's able to produce grain.</b></font>

10
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hence the bars and breweries.</b></font>

11
00:01:52,910 --> 00:01:54,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm...</b></font>

12
00:01:54,490 --> 00:01:57,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN 1] Old Man Fass
was spinning quite the yarn.</b></font>

13
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:59,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Says he's almost found Boshaft.</b></font>

14
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:01,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN 2] Think he means it?</b></font>

15
00:02:01,330 --> 00:02:02,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's been digging...</b></font>

16
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:04,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I supposed to know
what Boshaft is?</b></font>

17
00:02:04,750 --> 00:02:07,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Master Heiter told me
when I was young.</b></font>

18
00:02:07,630 --> 00:02:09,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Long ago, most of the continent
was ruled</b></font>

19
00:02:10,010 --> 00:02:11,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by a single great empire.</b></font>

20
00:02:11,510 --> 00:02:15,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Boshaft was an exquisite liquor
crafted for the emperor.</b></font>

21
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hmm.</b></font>

22
00:02:17,010 --> 00:02:18,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because of Mistress Frieren,</b></font>

23
00:02:18,930 --> 00:02:20,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Master Heiter
never got to partake.</b></font>

24
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:22,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

25
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I crushed his dream
for good reason.</b></font>

26
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door creaks open]</b></font>

27
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:33,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like to move in
and out of this city quickly.</b></font>

28
00:02:33,610 --> 00:02:34,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once we're finished shopping,
we should--</b></font>

29
00:02:34,910 --> 00:02:35,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] Frieren?</b></font>

30
00:02:36,490 --> 00:02:38,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As I live and breathe!</b></font>

31
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[pants]</b></font>

32
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:44,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't seen you
in a century.</b></font>

33
00:02:44,250 --> 00:02:46,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Just a brief
80 years, Fass.</b></font>

34
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:48,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] You're a stickler
for details now?</b></font>

35
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Time has changed you. Mmm.</b></font>

36
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:54,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it's changed
your roster, too.</b></font>

37
00:02:54,170 --> 00:02:57,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lost the young drunkard
somewhere along the way?</b></font>

38
00:02:57,930 --> 00:03:00,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The corrupt priest is dead.</b></font>

39
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:01,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Heiter went peacefully.</b></font>

40
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:03,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fass sighs]</b></font>

41
00:03:03,930 --> 00:03:05,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] I see.</b></font>

42
00:03:05,230 --> 00:03:07,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, I was too late, then.</b></font>

43
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:11,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] I did it.</b></font>

44
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:13,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've finally located Boshaft.</b></font>

45
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:15,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just need a final push.</b></font>

46
00:03:15,490 --> 00:03:18,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your magic
would come in very handy.</b></font>

47
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:21,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't understand how my magic
has anything to do with Boshaft.</b></font>

48
00:03:22,450 --> 00:03:24,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] Then let me show you.</b></font>

49
00:03:24,410 --> 00:03:25,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

50
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:33,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] It's in here.</b></font>

51
00:03:33,170 --> 00:03:36,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] How curious.
Is this a mine?</b></font>

52
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:39,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] Dug it myself.
This mine's all mine.</b></font>

53
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Folks assume
that all of us dwarves</b></font>

54
00:03:42,970 --> 00:03:44,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>have mining in our blood.</b></font>

55
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I grew up in the city.</b></font>

56
00:03:48,150 --> 00:03:51,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I started my journey
from scratch.</b></font>

57
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:55,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A small price to pay
for that legendary liquor.</b></font>

58
00:03:55,990 --> 00:03:57,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You want to give us
a little context</b></font>

59
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:58,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on the old guy?</b></font>

60
00:03:58,860 --> 00:03:59,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's Fass.</b></font>

61
00:03:59,950 --> 00:04:02,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one loves liquor
as much as him.</b></font>

62
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:05,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's spent over 200 years
searching for Boshaft.</b></font>

63
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:08,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Eighty years ago,
he asked my previous party</b></font>

64
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:11,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for assistance as well,
but believe it or not,</b></font>

65
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:13,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we had a Demon King
to defeat at the time.</b></font>

66
00:04:13,670 --> 00:04:15,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So we declined.</b></font>

67
00:04:15,210 --> 00:04:17,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Heiter exclaims]
My precious, Boshaft!</b></font>

68
00:04:17,170 --> 00:04:18,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] Let go already!</b></font>

69
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:21,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Heiter cries]
-[Himmel grunts]</b></font>

70
00:04:21,550 --> 00:04:23,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Pulling Heiter
away from the search</b></font>

71
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was no mean feat.</b></font>

72
00:04:25,220 --> 00:04:27,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
Your mine is very impressive.</b></font>

73
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:29,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But why would
the liquor be down here?</b></font>

74
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:32,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS]
According to local legend,</b></font>

75
00:04:32,060 --> 00:04:34,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's a large store of Boshaft</b></font>

76
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:36,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>locked somewhere
in the underground ruins.</b></font>

77
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:41,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] And the legend is true.</b></font>

78
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:43,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I confirmed that
much two centuries ago</b></font>

79
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:46,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I found
this stone monument.</b></font>

80
00:04:46,910 --> 00:04:48,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's written in ancient Elvish.</b></font>

81
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The inscription proclaims</b></font>

82
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:54,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Boshaft is the finest spirit
of all time.</b></font>

83
00:04:54,590 --> 00:04:56,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Milliarde."</b></font>

84
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:59,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That must be
who engraved the stone.</b></font>

85
00:05:01,140 --> 00:05:02,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] You're awfully
well-educated.</b></font>

86
00:05:03,010 --> 00:05:06,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've never met a young lady
so fluent in ancient Elvish.</b></font>

87
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's my mistress.</b></font>

88
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She drilled it into me
when I was young.</b></font>

89
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:13,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Most grimoires are written</b></font>

90
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:14,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in ancient Elvish, Fern.</b></font>

91
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you want to be a mage,</b></font>

92
00:05:15,730 --> 00:05:17,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll have to learn
how to read it.</b></font>

93
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern groans softly]</b></font>

94
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, it was Milliarde after all.</b></font>

95
00:05:24,410 --> 00:05:25,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Huh?</b></font>

96
00:05:25,740 --> 00:05:27,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] Ever since discovering
this inscription,</b></font>

97
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:31,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've dedicated my long life
to finding Boshaft.</b></font>

98
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:35,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And after all these years,
it's almost within my grasp.</b></font>

99
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] You found the ruins?</b></font>

100
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:41,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] Yes. Locating the store
isn't the problem.</b></font>

101
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:44,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's these doors.</b></font>

102
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Someone put up
a powerful barrier.</b></font>

103
00:05:46,890 --> 00:05:49,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose they didn't want
a drunk dwarf like me</b></font>

104
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>raiding their liquor cabinet.</b></font>

105
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:52,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You on the other hand...</b></font>

106
00:05:52,850 --> 00:05:55,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you should be able
to break through.</b></font>

107
00:05:58,110 --> 00:05:59,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I can't.</b></font>

108
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] Somehow, I doubt that.</b></font>

109
00:06:01,780 --> 00:06:04,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Removing the barrier
will be a tedious task.</b></font>

110
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:06,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These kids won't appreciate
the wait.</b></font>

111
00:06:06,780 --> 00:06:09,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] I'll make it
worth your while.</b></font>

112
00:06:09,620 --> 00:06:10,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With a grimoire?</b></font>

113
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:11,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] With money!</b></font>

114
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:14,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll pay you
twenty Reich gold coins.</b></font>

115
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:18,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not worth considering.</b></font>

116
00:06:19,210 --> 00:06:20,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] Please, Frieren!</b></font>

117
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:23,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not only is tasting Boshaft
my dream, it's my life's work!</b></font>

118
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:25,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've poured every day
I've had into this</b></font>

119
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:27,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for over two hundred years!</b></font>

120
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:30,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't.</b></font>

121
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fass exclaims softly]</b></font>

122
00:06:32,060 --> 00:06:33,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fass sighs]</b></font>

123
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:37,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren, would it be
so wrong to help him?</b></font>

124
00:06:37,690 --> 00:06:38,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He needs a mage.</b></font>

125
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:41,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you wanna make
an old man's dream come true?</b></font>

126
00:06:41,150 --> 00:06:43,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your change of heart
is disturbing.</b></font>

127
00:06:43,110 --> 00:06:45,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'd normally object
to this sort of thing.</b></font>

128
00:06:45,450 --> 00:06:48,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren,
he's offering 20 gold coins.</b></font>

129
00:06:48,330 --> 00:06:49,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We need money.</b></font>

130
00:06:49,530 --> 00:06:50,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll finally be able
to buy food and gear</b></font>

131
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:52,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without bleeding
our pockets dry!</b></font>

132
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:54,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren groans]</b></font>

133
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:55,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just so you know,</b></font>

134
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this barrier will take me
three months to remove.</b></font>

135
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:59,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] That's hardly
any time at all.</b></font>

136
00:06:59,670 --> 00:07:00,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] What?</b></font>

137
00:07:01,460 --> 00:07:03,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Glad to be on board!</b></font>

138
00:07:04,010 --> 00:07:06,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Don't come
crying to me later.</b></font>

139
00:07:06,550 --> 00:07:08,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

140
00:07:24,190 --> 00:07:27,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] We're in the final stages
of removing the barrier.</b></font>

141
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:30,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our work here
shall be done tomorrow.</b></font>

142
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:37,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] You don't look
very pleased.</b></font>

143
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:43,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For I'm not.</b></font>

144
00:07:43,090 --> 00:07:45,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Boshaft doesn't taste good.</b></font>

145
00:07:45,170 --> 00:07:46,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's dreadful.</b></font>

146
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:49,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And certainly not worth
200 years of devotion.</b></font>

147
00:07:50,010 --> 00:07:52,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But the inscription praised it.</b></font>

148
00:07:53,930 --> 00:07:55,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Long life comes at a cost.</b></font>

149
00:07:56,350 --> 00:07:57,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Elves will do anything</b></font>

150
00:07:57,690 --> 00:08:00,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to avoid being crushed
by the weight of boredom.</b></font>

151
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

152
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:05,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

153
00:08:13,740 --> 00:08:15,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Anytime I see you, Milliarde,</b></font>

154
00:08:15,750 --> 00:08:17,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you're staring off into space.</b></font>

155
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Many of our fellow elves</b></font>

156
00:08:19,670 --> 00:08:21,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>tie themselves
to a grand pursuit.</b></font>

157
00:08:21,670 --> 00:08:24,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Some glorious
and lifelong adventure.</b></font>

158
00:08:24,550 --> 00:08:26,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Know why that is?</b></font>

159
00:08:26,470 --> 00:08:27,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go on.</b></font>

160
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:31,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So that they don't end up
like me.</b></font>

161
00:08:32,390 --> 00:08:33,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren...</b></font>

162
00:08:33,810 --> 00:08:36,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Suppose you spent a lifetime
searching for something</b></font>

163
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>only to find it was worthless...</b></font>

164
00:08:38,810 --> 00:08:40,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Imagine the feeling.</b></font>

165
00:08:40,810 --> 00:08:42,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I cannot.</b></font>

166
00:08:42,150 --> 00:08:44,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What is it you're talking about?</b></font>

167
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:46,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, nothing interesting.</b></font>

168
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:48,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just my distant past.</b></font>

169
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:53,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This liquor is terrible.</b></font>

170
00:08:53,780 --> 00:08:54,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Disgusting.</b></font>

171
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:57,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's Boshaft, right?</b></font>

172
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They served it to everyone
at the coronation</b></font>

173
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because it's
exceptionally cheap.</b></font>

174
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:03,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MILLIARDE]
Before coming to this village,</b></font>

175
00:09:03,580 --> 00:09:05,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I carved
a mysterious inscription</b></font>

176
00:09:05,590 --> 00:09:07,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into a block of stone.</b></font>

177
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:11,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It said, "Boshaft is
the finest spirit of all time."</b></font>

178
00:09:11,970 --> 00:09:14,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What exactly was the point
of doing that?</b></font>

179
00:09:15,970 --> 00:09:18,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MILLIARDE]
There was no point at all.</b></font>

180
00:09:22,690 --> 00:09:24,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] It's finally time.</b></font>

181
00:09:38,580 --> 00:09:39,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fass gasps]</b></font>

182
00:09:40,710 --> 00:09:43,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fass laughs]</b></font>

183
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:47,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] It's perfectly preserved!</b></font>

184
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:49,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't believe
that after all these years,</b></font>

185
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I get to taste it.</b></font>

186
00:09:51,670 --> 00:09:53,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's have a toast.</b></font>

187
00:09:53,470 --> 00:09:55,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not drinking alone!</b></font>

188
00:10:01,980 --> 00:10:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gulping]</b></font>

189
00:10:05,810 --> 00:10:07,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is...</b></font>

190
00:10:11,070 --> 00:10:13,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEITER] Frieren,
the Boshaft was so close,</b></font>

191
00:10:13,570 --> 00:10:15,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could taste it.
Why drag us away?</b></font>

192
00:10:18,580 --> 00:10:21,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're a connoisseur
of liquor, aren't you?</b></font>

193
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But of course I am.</b></font>

194
00:10:22,460 --> 00:10:25,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How very priestly of you,
corrupt priest.</b></font>

195
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:27,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Let's say you've found a spirit</b></font>

196
00:10:27,130 --> 00:10:29,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you've searched for
your entire life.</b></font>

197
00:10:29,210 --> 00:10:31,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What would you do
if it was terrible?</b></font>

198
00:10:32,090 --> 00:10:33,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

199
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:37,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mmm. You want to know
what I would do?</b></font>

200
00:10:38,010 --> 00:10:39,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would laugh it off.</b></font>

201
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:42,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can't drink it for the taste?
It's booze.</b></font>

202
00:10:42,310 --> 00:10:44,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's best shared with friends.</b></font>

203
00:10:49,110 --> 00:10:50,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] It's so...</b></font>

204
00:10:52,780 --> 00:10:53,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It's terrible.</b></font>

205
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:57,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would go so far as to say
it's the worst drink I've had.</b></font>

206
00:10:59,030 --> 00:11:00,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

207
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:02,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Don't sit back and watch.</b></font>

208
00:11:02,410 --> 00:11:04,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Join in our misery, Stark.</b></font>

209
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:07,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I think I'm good.
You said it's terrible.</b></font>

210
00:11:07,170 --> 00:11:09,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Find out for yourself.</b></font>

211
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:14,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gags] This is disgusting.</b></font>

212
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[coughs]
-Did you enjoy?</b></font>

213
00:11:16,090 --> 00:11:17,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I'll give it to you this time.
-Have more.</b></font>

214
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:20,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should've left this garbage
in the ground!</b></font>

215
00:11:21,390 --> 00:11:23,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS]
It really is terrible.</b></font>

216
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

217
00:11:24,850 --> 00:11:27,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]
We've got plenty to go around.</b></font>

218
00:11:27,730 --> 00:11:31,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I'm prepared to make
the whole city suffer with me.</b></font>

219
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:33,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

220
00:11:34,570 --> 00:11:35,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FASS] Frieren?</b></font>

221
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:38,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My search may have ended
in disappointment,</b></font>

222
00:11:38,530 --> 00:11:41,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I've never had
such a fun night.</b></font>

223
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:44,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm glad you three stuck around
for the party.</b></font>

224
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:49,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing that pairs
with bad liquor</b></font>

225
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>quite like good times.</b></font>

226
00:11:51,210 --> 00:11:52,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fass laughs]</b></font>

227
00:12:02,970 --> 00:12:05,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 33: LOGISTICS
IN THE NORTHERN PLATEAU</b></font>

228
00:12:05,930 --> 00:12:07,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>30 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

229
00:12:07,890 --> 00:12:09,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN NORM COMPANY TERRITORY,
LOCATED ON THE NORTHERN PLATEAU</b></font>

230
00:12:12,730 --> 00:12:15,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here. Take your share
of today's bread.</b></font>

231
00:12:18,910 --> 00:12:20,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is this some kind of sick joke?</b></font>

232
00:12:20,660 --> 00:12:22,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It clunked.
You ever hear bread clunk?</b></font>

233
00:12:23,580 --> 00:12:25,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I know anything,
it's that bread shouldn't clunk.</b></font>

234
00:12:26,290 --> 00:12:27,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
It's been a week of this,</b></font>

235
00:12:27,830 --> 00:12:30,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and each day,
the bread gets more rock-like.</b></font>

236
00:12:30,830 --> 00:12:32,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Complaining will
get you nowhere.</b></font>

237
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:36,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As you saw, the Bier region
has its share of grain,</b></font>

238
00:12:36,050 --> 00:12:38,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but beyond that,
the Northern Plateau is barren.</b></font>

239
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And from what I can tell,</b></font>

240
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:42,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>goods aren't circulating
right now.</b></font>

241
00:12:42,510 --> 00:12:43,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>While we're on the road,</b></font>

242
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:45,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>don't expect anything
but this delightful treat.</b></font>

243
00:12:45,890 --> 00:12:48,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, how depressing.</b></font>

244
00:12:49,230 --> 00:12:50,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Muster your zeal, complainers.</b></font>

245
00:12:50,980 --> 00:12:53,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There should be a decent meal
within a half day's walk.</b></font>

246
00:12:53,770 --> 00:12:55,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

247
00:13:07,410 --> 00:13:09,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] That's
an impressive fortress city.</b></font>

248
00:13:10,330 --> 00:13:12,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It's the Norm Company's estate.</b></font>

249
00:13:12,540 --> 00:13:15,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The structure in the center
is their headquarters.</b></font>

250
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They deal in various goods,</b></font>

251
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:19,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>primarily wheat
from the Bier region.</b></font>

252
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:22,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unlike many
smaller trading companies,</b></font>

253
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they're armed.</b></font>

254
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:26,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They have the logistical ability
and military force</b></font>

255
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:29,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to supply the villages
dotted across the plateau.</b></font>

256
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not even the state
can touch them.</b></font>

257
00:13:31,690 --> 00:13:34,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Practically speaking,
they control all human life</b></font>

258
00:13:34,190 --> 00:13:36,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that graces
the Northern Plateau.</b></font>

259
00:13:36,270 --> 00:13:37,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, they supply the villages?</b></font>

260
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:40,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But earlier, you said
goods aren't circulating.</b></font>

261
00:13:40,700 --> 00:13:42,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] And that's a problem.</b></font>

262
00:13:42,740 --> 00:13:44,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know
the specific cause,</b></font>

263
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I'm sure time
has changed things.</b></font>

264
00:13:47,490 --> 00:13:51,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps the Norm Company
isn't as mighty as it once was.</b></font>

265
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:54,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Regardless, I imagine they still
have a great deal of influence</b></font>

266
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:57,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>over the goings on
and daily life on the plateau.</b></font>

267
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:00,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As such, we should avoid
making waves.</b></font>

268
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

269
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:10,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RECEPTIONIST] Very good.</b></font>

270
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:12,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First-class mages
are welcome to pass.</b></font>

271
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:15,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Travel safe, Miss Fern.</b></font>

272
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mmm.</b></font>

273
00:14:17,770 --> 00:14:19,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That elf...</b></font>

274
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Mm?</b></font>

275
00:14:22,490 --> 00:14:23,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exclaims softly]</b></font>

276
00:14:28,490 --> 00:14:30,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RECEPTIONIST]
One moment please.</b></font>

277
00:14:32,460 --> 00:14:33,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] I wonder what's going on.</b></font>

278
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[door closes]
-[FRIEREN] Hm.</b></font>

279
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:42,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am Norm,
the company president.</b></font>

280
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I take it
you're Miss Frieren</b></font>

281
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:45,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the party of heroes.</b></font>

282
00:14:45,970 --> 00:14:48,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm afraid
you owe me some money.</b></font>

283
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's eighty years of debt
to be paid in full.</b></font>

284
00:14:52,350 --> 00:14:53,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you been carrying debt</b></font>

285
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:56,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for our entire journey
together, Mistress?</b></font>

286
00:14:56,190 --> 00:14:57,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just a little.</b></font>

287
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:58,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're doomed, huh?</b></font>

288
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:01,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was told eighty years ago,
I could pay it back at any time.</b></font>

289
00:15:01,940 --> 00:15:04,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That is unfortunately
not what the documents say.</b></font>

290
00:15:04,740 --> 00:15:07,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A verbal agreement
won't hold up.</b></font>

291
00:15:07,070 --> 00:15:09,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It seems my predecessor's
predecessor</b></font>

292
00:15:09,330 --> 00:15:10,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>had a more relaxed approach.</b></font>

293
00:15:11,450 --> 00:15:13,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I didn't inherit
his generosity.</b></font>

294
00:15:15,830 --> 00:15:18,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NORM] That's three Strahl
and twenty Reich gold.</b></font>

295
00:15:18,590 --> 00:15:20,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Various silvers
and coppers, too.</b></font>

296
00:15:20,670 --> 00:15:22,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quite the fortune
you've acquired.</b></font>

297
00:15:23,170 --> 00:15:25,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're as wealthy
as a minor noble.</b></font>

298
00:15:25,630 --> 00:15:29,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know. Your dear grandfather
did my party a great favor</b></font>

299
00:15:29,430 --> 00:15:32,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>back in his day. I'll let you
keep the change, sonny.</b></font>

300
00:15:34,230 --> 00:15:35,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My!</b></font>

301
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:39,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm afraid
this isn't nearly enough.</b></font>

302
00:15:41,020 --> 00:15:43,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It seems I'll be working
in the company's mines</b></font>

303
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:45,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for the next
three hundred years.</b></font>

304
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:47,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You may journey forth,
but my journey ends here.</b></font>

305
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:49,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both exclaim softly]</b></font>

306
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:53,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] What are you
talking about, Mistress Frieren?</b></font>

307
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:56,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you lose your bag in there?
And your clothing?</b></font>

308
00:15:56,870 --> 00:15:59,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They snapped up all my
worldly possessions</b></font>

309
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:00,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as collateral.</b></font>

310
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:02,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

311
00:16:03,210 --> 00:16:04,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

312
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:06,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren whimpers]</b></font>

313
00:16:06,930 --> 00:16:08,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[inhales and exhales angrily]</b></font>

314
00:16:08,970 --> 00:16:10,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[inhales and exhales loudly]</b></font>

315
00:16:10,890 --> 00:16:12,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

316
00:16:14,140 --> 00:16:15,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[miners grunt]</b></font>

317
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:21,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Farewell, Fern, Stark.
Lead full lives.</b></font>

318
00:16:24,530 --> 00:16:26,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

319
00:16:26,990 --> 00:16:28,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-What are we going to do now?
-[Fern sighs]</b></font>

320
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:32,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We have no choice but to
buy back Mistress Frieren.</b></font>

321
00:16:32,950 --> 00:16:35,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's not another grimoire,
you know.</b></font>

322
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:37,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A very noble pursuit,</b></font>

323
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:39,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but unfortunately,
there's nothing you can do.</b></font>

324
00:16:39,330 --> 00:16:40,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See for yourself.</b></font>

325
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:46,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The interest
has really piled up on her.</b></font>

326
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:48,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She owes over
five hundred Strahl gold.</b></font>

327
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:51,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Convert it into the region's
Reich gold currency,</b></font>

328
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:54,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and Frieren still owes me
over 300 coins.</b></font>

329
00:16:54,310 --> 00:16:57,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you believe you can procure
such a sum, I'm all ears.</b></font>

330
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:00,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That would be impossible.</b></font>

331
00:17:00,230 --> 00:17:02,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plan A is out of the question.</b></font>

332
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:06,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And we don't have 300 years
to wait around.</b></font>

333
00:17:11,450 --> 00:17:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
I thoroughly detest mines.</b></font>

334
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:17,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's like cooking
in a dusty clay oven.</b></font>

335
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:18,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[footsteps]
-[Frieren gasps]</b></font>

336
00:17:22,630 --> 00:17:24,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren groans softly]</b></font>

337
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:30,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The president told us
all about you, Miss Frieren.</b></font>

338
00:17:30,220 --> 00:17:31,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The pleasure's ours.</b></font>

339
00:17:33,140 --> 00:17:34,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Indeed.</b></font>

340
00:17:35,100 --> 00:17:36,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shall we get started then?</b></font>

341
00:17:40,690 --> 00:17:42,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

342
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:50,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[miners gasp, grunt]</b></font>

343
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:15,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[miner exclaims, grunts]</b></font>

344
00:18:28,230 --> 00:18:30,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aim your axes
at this wall here.</b></font>

345
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:32,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're sure about this?</b></font>

346
00:18:33,110 --> 00:18:35,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you know who I am,
you shouldn't have to ask.</b></font>

347
00:18:37,490 --> 00:18:38,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, you heard the lady.</b></font>

348
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Start digging, boys.</b></font>

349
00:18:40,620 --> 00:18:42,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MINERS] Sir!</b></font>

350
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:44,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all grunting]</b></font>

351
00:18:56,430 --> 00:18:57,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
When I met your president</b></font>

352
00:18:57,800 --> 00:19:00,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>two generations ago,
he was a cast-out nobleman,</b></font>

353
00:19:00,470 --> 00:19:02,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>driven to the plateau
by necessity.</b></font>

354
00:19:03,430 --> 00:19:05,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He invested in this barren land</b></font>

355
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:07,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and created a logistics network.</b></font>

356
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:09,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He brought stability
to the unstable,</b></font>

357
00:19:09,730 --> 00:19:10,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>making him a savior</b></font>

358
00:19:11,110 --> 00:19:13,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the people who call
the Northern Plateau home.</b></font>

359
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:17,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At the time, most nobles
turned up their noses</b></font>

360
00:19:17,490 --> 00:19:19,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at our ragtag party of heroes.</b></font>

361
00:19:19,450 --> 00:19:22,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But he provided us funds
with no repayment deadline.</b></font>

362
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:26,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never would have guessed</b></font>

363
00:19:26,870 --> 00:19:29,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>his grandson would treat me
with such disrespect.</b></font>

364
00:19:31,130 --> 00:19:32,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But a busy man like you</b></font>

365
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:33,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>wouldn't trek down
to such depths</b></font>

366
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without good reason.</b></font>

367
00:19:35,170 --> 00:19:37,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If there's something
you wish to ask, ask it.</b></font>

368
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:40,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We have lost our grip
on logistics.</b></font>

369
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:42,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can tell that much, yes?</b></font>

370
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose so.</b></font>

371
00:19:44,100 --> 00:19:45,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My companions complain</b></font>

372
00:19:45,390 --> 00:19:46,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they've never had
to suffer through</b></font>

373
00:19:46,810 --> 00:19:48,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>such rock-hard bread before.</b></font>

374
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:51,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NORM] I believe it. I'm not
particularly fond myself.</b></font>

375
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:53,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When it rains, it pours.</b></font>

376
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:55,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the Norm Company
is drowning.</b></font>

377
00:19:56,530 --> 00:19:59,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've lost
a third of our troops,</b></font>

378
00:19:59,070 --> 00:20:02,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>their lives taken and caravans
destroyed by the demons.</b></font>

379
00:20:05,250 --> 00:20:07,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our logistics network
is in ruins.</b></font>

380
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:10,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If the Norm Company
were a nation,</b></font>

381
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:12,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we would have fallen by now.</b></font>

382
00:20:17,470 --> 00:20:20,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But we're not a nation.
We're a trading company.</b></font>

383
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:23,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As long as we have the funds...</b></font>

384
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:26,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we can rebuild.</b></font>

385
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:29,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When you arrived in this region,</b></font>

386
00:20:29,730 --> 00:20:32,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I felt you were hand-delivered
by the Goddess herself.</b></font>

387
00:20:33,610 --> 00:20:36,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What was once a scrap of paper
marked with your party's names,</b></font>

388
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:39,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>became my ticket out of ruin.</b></font>

389
00:20:40,360 --> 00:20:43,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This mine is rich,
but still under development.</b></font>

390
00:20:43,530 --> 00:20:44,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we strike silver,</b></font>

391
00:20:44,700 --> 00:20:46,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then we will turn
a great profit.</b></font>

392
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:48,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Enough to rebuild
what the demons stole,</b></font>

393
00:20:48,540 --> 00:20:51,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and enough to repay
your party's debt.</b></font>

394
00:20:52,090 --> 00:20:54,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Finding silver
should be a simple task</b></font>

395
00:20:54,130 --> 00:20:55,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for the legendary Frieren.</b></font>

396
00:20:56,210 --> 00:20:57,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Legendary"?</b></font>

397
00:20:57,840 --> 00:20:59,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It would take
more than a scrap of paper</b></font>

398
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:02,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to bend a legend
into doing your bidding.</b></font>

399
00:21:03,180 --> 00:21:05,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NORM] If our logistics network
falls apart,</b></font>

400
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:07,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>countless people will starve
and die.</b></font>

401
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:09,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miss Frieren,</b></font>

402
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>please save the people
of the Northern Plateau.</b></font>

403
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:13,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I beseech you.</b></font>

404
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:18,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's more,
if you help us locate silver,</b></font>

405
00:21:18,950 --> 00:21:20,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll ensure
the bread here is soft.</b></font>

406
00:21:20,740 --> 00:21:23,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Otherwise, days of rocks
await you.</b></font>

407
00:21:23,410 --> 00:21:25,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If nothing else,
you certainly inherited</b></font>

408
00:21:25,490 --> 00:21:27,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>your grandfather's shrewdness.</b></font>

409
00:21:27,540 --> 00:21:30,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is why I avoid
working with merchants.</b></font>

410
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:33,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have a deal.
Not that you need one.</b></font>

411
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:36,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I intended to repay the debt
I owed your grandfather</b></font>

412
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:38,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at one point or another.</b></font>

413
00:21:39,170 --> 00:21:40,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

414
00:21:43,430 --> 00:21:45,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MINER]
I can't believe we did it.</b></font>

415
00:21:45,390 --> 00:21:47,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've never seen so much silver.</b></font>

416
00:21:47,350 --> 00:21:48,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles]</b></font>

417
00:21:55,610 --> 00:21:58,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've returned.
My journey shall continue.</b></font>

418
00:21:59,030 --> 00:22:00,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You nailed the timing.</b></font>

419
00:22:00,650 --> 00:22:03,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were just coming up
with a way to bust you out.</b></font>

420
00:22:03,740 --> 00:22:06,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our plan was to raid the mine
once the sun went down.</b></font>

421
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:09,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Goodness. You're so hot-blooded.</b></font>

422
00:22:10,750 --> 00:22:12,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
This detour wasn't for naught.</b></font>

423
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:15,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll get to eat soft bread
from now on.</b></font>

424
00:22:16,380 --> 00:22:19,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Huh?
I'm a little lost here.</b></font>

425
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:22,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

426
00:23:49,970 --> 00:23:51,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
I was worried to death.</b></font>

427
00:23:51,260 --> 00:23:52,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
I'll help you bury them.</b></font>

428
00:23:52,310 --> 00:23:53,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CAPTAIN]
Protect the villagers!</b></font>

429
00:23:53,600 --> 00:23:55,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It seems
we were one step behind.</b></font>

430
00:23:55,350 --> 00:23:56,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN]
There were so few of them.</b></font>

431
00:23:56,640 --> 00:23:58,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[METHODE]
So, Miss Fern also received</b></font>

432
00:23:58,350 --> 00:23:59,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a demon-slaying request?</b></font>

